385..460 Comment "/// The sum of two integers (cubical\'s `_+_` on `ℤ`), by recursion on the"
461..535 Comment "/// second. It respects `Int`\'s rules: at `S(P(x))` it builds `S(P(plus(a,"
536..590 Comment "/// x)))`, which the first rule reads as `plus(a, x)`."
