1734..1811 Comment "/// The sum commutes (cubical\'s `+Comm`), by induction on the second summand,"
1812..1886 Comment "/// each step the recursive call carried along `up` or `down` and then the"
1887..1964 Comment "/// summand brought out of the left. The arms compose to no conversion of the"
1965..2039 Comment "/// answer at `x`, yet `Int` is a set, so its rules are respected by their"
2040..2067 Comment "/// endpoints alone (#427)."
